WEBVTT

00:17:00.912 --> 00:17:04.329
OK, good. Absolutely. I'm really I've
never flipped a coin to make

00:17:04.329 --> 00:17:05.663
a decision in my life.

00:17:06.579 --> 00:17:08.746
The version of the story I heard
was that you would flip

00:17:08.746 --> 00:17:11.246
the coin to observe your
own emotional reaction

00:17:11.454 --> 00:17:13.204
and figure out what your biases were.

00:17:14.329 --> 00:17:18.329
I might have said that this is one of
the benefits of flipping a coin,

00:17:18.329 --> 00:17:22.829
but I personally have never used that.
But it's true that.

00:17:24.204 --> 00:17:28.329
Flipping a coin would be a way of
discovering how you feel if you didn't

00:17:28.329 --> 00:17:30.704
know earlier that I still believe,